    <scopecontent>
      <head>Scope and Content</head>
      <p>The Cherry Hill Farmhouse archive from 1876 to 1992 consists of the following documents:
        Reports, Public Notices, Architectural Archaeological Comments, Programs, Minutes,
        Correspondence, etc. </p>
      <p>The archive is organized as follows: <list>
          <item>Series 1: Council Meetings </item>
          <item>Series 2: Restoration</item>
          <item>Series 3: Riley Family</item>
          <item>Series 4: Cherry Hill Board</item>
          <item>Series 5: Historical Commission</item>
          <item>Series 6: Anniversary</item>
          <item>Series 7: Reports</item>
          <item>Series 8: Time Capsule</item>
          <item>Series 9: Events and Programs</item>
          <item>Series 10: Printed Materials</item>
          <item>Series 11: League of Women Voters</item>
        </list>
      </p>
    </scopecontent>
